      <div class="col info-col"><div class="title">보안센터</div>안전거래 안내</div>
      <div class="col info-col"><div class="title">이체내역</div>거래 조회</div>
      <div class="col info-col"><div class="title">고객센터</div>1588-0000</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container py-3" style="max-width: 900px;">
{{>footer}}
